  <item>
    <title>08 过度准备|别总是等一切准备好了再开始</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6618cd3f5dae7932c603f393</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6618cd3f5dae7932c603f393</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Apr 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，我是西西🤭，今天和大家分享的话题是“过度准备”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是否常常想着等一切准备好了才去尝试开始？你是不是有许多想法、计划，就因为根深蒂固的「等我准备好了再行动」的思维模式，最终付诸东流?今天就和大家来探讨这种导向背后的心态机制和过度准备可能导致的后果。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a>过度准备的后果</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a>你目标和当下能力水平之间的差距，就是你的潜力。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a>「后悔的时间模型」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a>「不确定的损失厌恶」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a>「行动导向」和「状态导向」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a>什么才是最好的准备?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a>很多改变是“由外而内”的，学会用行为反向塑造认知</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">06:54</a>先上场，再适应，再调整</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvvrdNmYuEmUlc5oPZHpPfGWIgO6.m4a" length="7366663" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:07:35</itunes:duration>
