  <item>
    <title>06 当坏事发生后，如何面对错误带来的结果？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661017274f66d1c1da34f573</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661017274f66d1c1da34f573</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Apr 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello,大家好，我是西西🤭，今天和大家聊的话题是“当坏事发生后，该怎么办？“，面对这个问题，我在两年前的日记本上找到了答案：</span></p><span></span><p><span>📔“当坏事发生后，</span></p><span></span><p><span>精神上劝服自己学会接受，并从中得到警戒，</span></p><span></span><p><span>行动上尝试寻找可以弥补损失的方式，并将损失降到最小。</span></p><span></span><p><span>成年人最体面的便是学会为自己行为买单。“</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> 当我误删了电脑的office后</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> 那个糟糕水逆的3月</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a> 遇到坏事后首先要解决情绪问题</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> “如何让坏事变成好事”的思维很重要</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a> 人只有经历自己的渺小，才能到达高尚</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">05:58</a> 错已铸成,如何调整心态去面对错误所产生的后果?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> 凡事发生只是打怪升级的必要流程</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgXyiROqg2TK9sI5pxCTkTJxLD88.m4a" length="8325392" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:08:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZpTHR1TEhUajdjZW80bFc0Z3RRS005UzhlazAucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
