  <item>
    <title>05 对抗焦虑：不提前预支烦恼</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660d40854f66d1c1dae06aba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660d40854f66d1c1dae06aba</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Apr 2024 11:41:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello,我是西西🤭。今天和大家聊的话题是"提前预知烦恼“，生活中的大多数人总是习惯预支明天的烦恼，让自己陷入焦虑内耗之中。而提前焦虑的下场往往是，既改变不了未来一定会到来的事实，又耗费了此刻的心情。我们可以对未来有规划有忧患意识，但是更重要的是要珍惜此时，把握当下。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> </span><strong><span>拒绝焦虑，活在当下</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> </span><strong><span>那些你所担忧的事情，99%都不会发生。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> </span><strong><span>让我们停滞不前的，往往不是现实的困难，而是脑海中的臆想</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a> </span><strong><span>稳定情绪，静待花开</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="202">03:22</a> </span><strong><span>减少焦虑的方法</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">04:41</a> </span><strong><span>天大的事情，顺其自然，也不过如此。</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpiY17DThBxyRGnbAaRDhxC8Z0nZ.m4a" length="5451886" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:05:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZpTHR1TEhUajdjZW80bFc0Z3RRS005UzhlazAucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
